msgid "Quantum subspace diagonalization tools {#quantum-subspace-diagonalization-tools}"
msgstr "Mga quantum subspace diagonalization tool {#quantum-subspace-diagonalization-tools}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These tools provide capabilities for building workflows to estimate the eigenvalues of quantum Hamiltonians, like the ground state energy of a molecule, using approaches such as sample-based quantum diagonalization that can scale beyond exact classical diagonalization methods. These workflows use a quantum circuit to sample candidate configurations, then iteratively refine the configurations and diagonalize the system’s Hamiltonian in the reduced subspace spanned by those configurations.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay ang mga tool na ito ng mga kakayahan para bumuo ng mga workflow na tumatantya sa mga eigenvalue ng mga quantum Hamiltonian, tulad ng ground state energy ng isang molecule, gamit ang mga approach tulad ng sample-based quantum diagonalization na kayang mag-scale nang lampas sa mga eksaktong classical diagonalization method. Gumagamit ang mga workflow na ito ng quantum Circuit para mag-sample ng mga candidate configuration, saka paulit-ulit na pinipino ang mga configuration at dina-diagonalize ang Hamiltonian ng system sa reduced subspace na sakop ng mga configuration na iyon.\n"
"<CardGroup>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization\"\n"
"      description=\"Estimate the spectrum of quantum Hamiltonians by processing noisy samples and diagonalizing in a reduced subspace.\"\n"
"      href=\"/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Overview page: SQD\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Browse documentation\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sample-based quantum diagonalization\"\n"
"      description=\"Tantyahin ang spectrum ng mga quantum Hamiltonian sa pamamagitan ng pagproseso ng mga maingay na sample at pag-diagonalize sa isang reduced subspace.\"\n"
